# Khor Beauty Admin Frontend Structure Documentation

## Backend Frontend (Admin Dashboard) Architecture

---

# 1. Project Overview

This structure belongs to:

```txt
Backend Frontend (Admin Management System)
```

Main purposes:

* Admin Dashboard
* Booking Management
* Customer Enquiries Management
* Services Management
* Payments Management
* Admin Settings
* Future Backend API Integration

Current stage:

```txt
UI Structure + Admin System Frontend
```

Future development will include:

```txt
Business Logic
Database
Authentication
API
CRM Logic
```

---

# 2. Core Project Architecture

```txt
backend/
```

Main project directory for the admin management system.

Technologies used:

| Technology             | Purpose                     |
| ---------------------- | --------------------------- |
| Next.js                | Frontend Framework          |
| TypeScript             | Type System                 |
| Tailwind CSS           | UI Styling                  |
| App Router             | Page Routing Structure      |
| Component Architecture | Component-based Development |

